type: software
title: "jepa-identifiability-boundary: Empirical boundary-mapping of the Klindt–LeCun–Balestriero Gaussian-identifiability theorem for Joint-Embedding Predictive Architectures"
authors:
  - given-names: Oğuz Emre
    family-names: Cura
